From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 09:25:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Remote transport: geometry-emulation pipelines, RPC census,
 batching, fence tracing

winemetal gains slot 133, MTLDevice_newGeometryEmulationPipelineState:
attachments as a WMTMeshRenderPipelineInfo plus a WMTGeometryEmulationInfo
naming the stage-in, vertex, geometry and fragment libraries; the remote
host builds the object/mesh functions with their function constants and
links the stage-in function. Remote guard regenerated, API count 134.

Also carried since the last commit: the remote client's per-opcode RPC
census and call batching (ml819-ml821), residency-set routing, the
D3D11 mesh-binding and tessellation fixes (ml754, ml867), the buffer
release ordering fix (ml789), fence path tracing (ml805) and the shared
port availability check (ml866).

Madeira-commit: 5925f5d4e91417f31241c9e532b62474ddd8dddb
Rebased: resolved
Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-24-dxmt-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
